<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage falls further Saturday.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage falls further Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell further to 5.389 billion rand on Saturday from 5.847 billion rand on Friday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
